// chriz-iwd-encounters 350: the Idol was attacked (CIE_IDOL_RALLY 1, set by its
// script): the greater mummies and zombie lords around it come to it (on top of the
// area script); their own scripts take over when they see the party. The boneguards
// in the corners stay where they are. CIE_IDOL_RALLY (area): 2 sent.

IF
  Global("CIE_IDOL_RALLY","MYAREA",1)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("CIE_IDOL_RALLY","MYAREA",2)%cie_idol_rally%
    Continue()
END
